{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/872878-nightmares-of-swallowing","id":872878,"title":"Nightmares of Swallowing","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-23T21:39:36-07:00","id":872878,"title":"Nightmares of Swallowing","content":"I would like to share a dream with you.<br /> <br /> I experience this dream frequently. Its cause is aridity, I think. Dehydration is a continuous problem.<br /> <br /> The setting of the dream is unimportant. It changes frequently, or is merely a vague impression. Whatever else is going on is subordinate to the front-scene action.<br /> <br /> There is something in my mouth that should not be there. It might be a screw, or a shard of glass. The other night it was a toenail. Gravity shifted in strange ways to get the trimmed toenail into my mouth. Whatever it is, the object would be harmful if swallowed. I try to keep it in my mouth. I try to spit it up. But in the end, I swallow it, and my last dreaming thoughts are my terror at what's going to happen to my insides. Can I digest glass or metal? I think not. Is this how I will die, by a mistake?<br /> <br /> I wake up, gasping and sometimes crying. I rush to the sink to spit. I am obsessed; it must be there, it must be, otherwise what did I just experience? I regurgitate.<br /> <br /> It is a bad scene which repeats itself on a troublingly regular basis. <br /> <br /> So, which Family do you think this nightmare fits itself into? I am uncertain. The dream plagues me. I cannot even psychoanalyze it to satisfaction, for I am too constrained by my biology. What is it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T22:24:51-07:00","id":872894,"title":"","content":"I feel that the nightmare fits near perfectly with a Namtaru, a creature of revulsion, or an Eshmaki, creature of the darkness. On the one hand, you're repelled by what you have in your mouth and what you've swallowed. On the other hand, you're also terrified about what it is doing where you can't see it inside of yourself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T22:28:35-07:00","id":872896,"title":"","content":"Namtaru was my first thought as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T22:58:35-07:00","id":872908,"title":"","content":"Yeah. Definitely Namtaru.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-25T19:08:06-07:00","id":874174,"title":"","content":"That sounds more like Eshmaki to me. The fear of dying because of something that is hard to see coming takes precedent over simply ingesting something unpleasant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}